(7755525, 1283122, 30861, '<td valign="top">Conceptually this cracks me up and dismays me at the same time... If, indeed, contraception was being used then yeah, this would be a failure-of, and that''s sly. And the same applies even if you just photographed a happily pregnant woman without even knowing if she''d been on contraception, to make this image. But at the same time, I''d sure hate for a soon-to-be-born baby to grow up and see this image of his mommy with this title :-(<br/> <br/>Anyway, you made me think :-) And giggle :-) And frown, and comment... That''s worth a 7 from me :-)</td>', 'Conceptually this cracks me up and dismays me at the same time... If, indeed, contraception was being used then yeah, this would be a failure-of, and that''s sly. And the same applies even if you just photographed a happily pregnant woman without even knowing if she''d been on contraception, to make this image. But at the same time, I''d sure hate for a soon-to-be-born baby to grow up and see this image of his mommy with this title :-( Anyway, you made me think :-) And giggle :-) And frown, and comment... That''s worth a 7 from me :-)', '2023-08-02 13:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7755527, 1283120, 30861, '<td valign="top">But...But... This isn''t a failure, it''s deliberate! And it''s a masterpiece! Guaranteed ribbon in a Rube Goldberg challenge :-)</td>', 'But...But... This isn''t a failure, it''s deliberate! And it''s a masterpiece! Guaranteed ribbon in a Rube Goldberg challenge :-)', '2023-08-02 13:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
