(7756122, 1283107, 50864, '<td valign="top">It aint right because the little man silhouette inside the big man silhouette is trying to break the chain in order to board that spaceship and escape this failed industrial complex.<br/> <br/>The tones, colors, and composition are wonderful. The complexity and clarity of this reflection are mesmerizing. <br/> <br/>Team spleen is in agreement that this is a winner.<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1282683" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50864/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1282683.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'It aint right because the little man silhouette inside the big man silhouette is trying to break the chain in order to board that spaceship and escape this failed industrial complex. The tones, colors, and composition are wonderful. The complexity and clarity of this reflection are mesmerizing.  Team spleen is in agreement that this is a winner. ', '2023-08-08 12:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
